</subpara>
<subpara id="X39400001JM00JJ_13" type-id="01" category="01">
<name>Procedure</name>
<testgrp id="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0019" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EQ900000">
<testtitle>Inspect Fuse (Instrument Panel Junction Block (HTR-IG))</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance of HTR-IG.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>HTR-IG</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0009" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0020" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0009" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EQ800000">
<testtitle>Inspect Magnetic Clutch Relay</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Remove the magnetic clutch relay from the engine room relay block.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each terminal of the connector.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="B016200" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
</test1>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.38in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.37in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 - 2</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>167Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 - 5</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>3 -5</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Apply battery voltage between terminals 1 and 2 of the connector</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0005" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0017" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0005" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EQ500000">
<testtitle>Inspect Cooler Compressor w/ Magnetic Clutch Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect connector B of the cooler compressor w/ magnetic clutch assembly.</ptxt>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Disconnect the magnetic clutch assembly connector.</ptxt>
</test1>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E155265J01" width="2.775699831in" height="3.779676365in"/>
</figure>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between each connector terminal and between the terminals and body ground.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B3(MG+) - C1(MG+)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>B3 (MG+) - Body ground</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>10k Ω or higher</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0022" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0013" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0022" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EQA00000">
<testtitle>Inspect Magnetic Clutch Assembly</testtitle>
<content6 releasenbr="1">
<sst>
<sstitem>
<s-number>09082-00030</s-number>
</sstitem>
</sst>
<test1>
<ptxt>Using SST (Toyota electrical tester), measure the resistance between the connector terminal and the ground wire.</ptxt>
<figure>
<graphic graphicname="E113611J02" width="2.775699831in" height="1.771723296in"/>
</figure>
<spec>
<title>Resistance</title>
<table>
<tgroup cols="3" align="center">
<colspec colname="COL1" colwidth="1.65in"/>
<colspec colname="COL2" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<colspec colname="COL3" colwidth="1.24in"/>
<thead>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Tester Connection (Terminal Symbol)</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Condition</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Standard</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</thead>
<tbody>
<row>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>1 (MG+) - Ground wire</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Always</ptxt>
</entry>
<entry valign="middle">
<ptxt>Below 1 Ω</ptxt>
</entry>
</row>
</tbody>
</tgroup>
</table>
</spec>
</test1>
<test1>
<ptxt>Inspect the magnetic clutch operation when the battery positive is connected to the connector terminal and the battery negative to the ground wire.</ptxt>
<spec>
<title>Specified Condition</title>
<specitem>
<ptxt>An operating sound is heard and the magnetic clutch hub and rotor lock.</ptxt>
</specitem>
</spec>
</test1>
</content6>
<res>
<down ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0006" fin="false">OK</down>
<right ref="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0023" fin="true">NG</right>
</res>
</testgrp>
<testgrp id="X39400001JM00JJ_13_0006" proc-id="RM0550J___0000EQ600000">
